**Terminal Operations Summary Report**

**Date:** October 10, 2023  
**Prepared by:** Maria Johnson, Operations Manager, Port Logistics Group

This report outlines the current state of operations at the Atlantic Container Terminal (ACT), focusing on cargo handling, vessel scheduling, and customs clearance processes. In recent weeks, we have optimized our systems to improve efficiency and reduce turnaround times. The collaboration between ACT and the Customs and Border Protection (CBP) has been instrumental in streamlining customs documentation, which has resulted in a 15% decrease in clearance time.

