The scheduling system, powered by the Port Management Software (PMS) developed by Harbor Tech Solutions, integrates with our cargo handling units and ensures real-time updates on vessel status. The collaboration between the terminal staff, led by Supervisor Matt Lee, and the cargo handling teams has enhanced loading and unloading efficiency.

### Customs Clearance Efficiency

| Customs Process      | Average Time (Hours) | Responsible Agency  |
|----------------------|----------------------|---------------------|
| Document Submission   | 2                    | Customs and Border Protection (CBP) |
| Inspection            | 4                    | CBP                 |
| Release               | 1                    | ACT                 |

The customs clearance process has been significantly improved by the implementation of the Automated Commercial Environment (ACE) system, which allows for electronic submission of cargo information. This system has reduced the average document submission time from 4 hours to 2 hours.

